 "title": "Homepage | Directorate of Treasuries, Pension and Entitlements, Uttarakhand | Secure, Scalable and Sugamya Website as a Service | India",
 "lang": "en-US",
 "metaDescription": "Secure, Scalable and Sugamya Website as a Service",
 "text": "उत्‍तराखण्‍ड सरकार\nGOVERNMENT OF UTTARAKHAND\nनिदेशालय कोषागार, पेंशन एवं हकदारी, उत्‍तराखण्‍ड\nDirectorate of Treasuries, Pension and Entitlements, Uttarakhand\nSearch\nSearch\nHome\nAbout Department\nDirectory\nCitizen’s Corner\nDocuments\nGovernment Orders\nUFS\nNotices\nPause\nLatest News\nImplementation of the PMS-e-DPR portal for the execution of all construction works of government departments. New\nImplementation of the PMS-e-DPR portal for the execution of all construction works of government departments. New\nImplementation of the PMS-e-DPR portal for the execution of all construction works of government departments. New\nShri Pushkar Singh Dhami\nHon'ble Chief Minister\nShri Ramesh Kumar Sudhanshu\nPrincipal Secretary\nShri Dilip Jawalkar\nSecretary\nSmt. Amita Joshi\nDirector\nAbout Department\n\nThe Directorate of Treasuries and Finance Services cum State internal Auditor was setup on 09.11.2000 on inception of the state. The Directorate is headed by senior officer of Uttarakhand Finance Services under administrative control of Department of Finance, Uttarakhand. The Directorate is mainly responsible for monitoring and control of all government payments and receipts made […]\n\nRead More\n\nNew Pension Schemes\n\nGovernment-backed retirement savings plan designed to provide financial security after retirement.\n\nMore\nServices\n\nServices that ensure the effective management of the state’s finances and contribute to economic development\n\nMore\nMeri Yojna Mera Adhikar\n\nVarious Schemes or Programs released under various department are displayed here.\n\n\n\nMore\n\nHelp Desk No: 8899890000\nFAQs\nImportant Information\nTraining Manuals\nURTSC\n\nCTRFA\ne-Jeewan Pramaan\nPFMS/DBT\n\nPro-Active-Discloser\nRTI Documents\nCirculars/Notifications\n\nOptional Tools for Downloads \n\nIFMS Signer (emBridge Signer)\n\n \n\nPDF Reader\n\nEvents\nMahatma Gandhi Jayanti – (02...\nOctober 12, 2026\n\nMahatma Gandhi Jayanti – (02 October 2026)\n\n \nDDO Training at Doon University\nMarch 30, 2025\nRelated Links\nUttarakhand IFMS\nUkosh e- Challan\nUttarakahnd e-Tender Portal\nRegistrar Of Firms, Societies and Chits Government Of Uttarakhand\nDepartment of Stamps & Registration Uttarakhand\nDepartment of Budget, Uttarakhand\nCommercial Tax Uttarakhand\ne-Services Apuni Sarkar\nImportant Links\nUttarakhand Government Order Portal\nIncome Tax Department\nGovt. of Uttarakhand\nHigh Court of Uttarakhand\nLegislative Assembly Uttarakhand\nUttarakhand State Disaster Management\n1905 CM Helpline Uttarakhand\nMinistry of Finance, Govt. of India\n \nPhoto Gallery\nView All Photos\nPause\nUseful Links\nFeedback\nWebsite Policies\nContact Us\nHelp\nWeb Information Manager\nSitemap\n\nContent Owned by : Treasuries, Pension and Entitlements, Uttarakhand\n\nDeveloped and hosted by National Informatics Centre, Ministry of Electronics & Information Technology, Government of India\n\nLast Updated: 16.10.2026",
